    emojis. The result is another emoji. Make sure that it's a single emoji. The
    normalizedRarity you can come up with a normalized value of how rare the emoji
    is. Make the name a totally made\u2011up, not refering to anything, delightfully
    oddball and short name. Make sure the short description is one concise sentence
    (10\u201320 words) that gives a flavorful, unique descriptor of the resulting
    gibble. Make sure to only answer with a single new description. It's important
    that you respond in JSON."
